Common Vibe Coding Fixes

GSAP Hydration Errors: Ensure all GSAP ScrollTrigger animations are wrapped in useLayoutEffect (or useEffect for SSR).

Lenis Window Error: Import Lenis dynamically or check typeof window !== "undefined" to prevent Next.js server build crashes.

Three.js Lag: Keep the polygon count of the background mesh low and wrap the canvas in a <Suspense> boundary.